<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stargazer</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --paper: #f7f1e8;
            --mist: #dfe7f2;
            --ink: #1a2430;
            --line: rgba(26, 36, 48, 0.14);
            --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
            --accent: #b4542a;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(180, 84, 42, 0.12), transparent 32%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, var(--paper) 0%, var(--mist) 100%);
        }

        main {
            width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem));
            margin: 10vh auto;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(26, 36, 48, 0.12);
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem);
            line-height: 0.95;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        strong {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        code {
            display: inline-block;
            max-width: 100%;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
            background: rgba(26, 36, 48, 0.06);
            border-radius: 0.35rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <p><strong>Bootstrap slice</strong></p>
    <h1>Stargazer is running on Symfony</h1>
    <p>
        The application scaffold and baseline dependencies are in place. Next up is the
        repository domain, sync pipeline, and reviewer-ready workflows from the plan.
    </p>
    <p>Current database target: <code>{{ databaseUrl }}</code></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
